window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I wasn't capable of love. Not until I met Cora.</p> <p>My angel.</p> <p>I’ve claimed every inch of her body, and I only want more.</p> <p>I’m a man who craves control, but her power over me is absolute.</p> <p>She holds my heart in her hands.</p> <p>She can never find out.</p> <p>The demons in this city want to destroy her.</p> <p>It’s my job to protect her innocence. Lock her safe in my high tower.</p> <p>But I’m the danger that she’s trying to escape.</p> <p>The ruthless man in her bed.</p> <p>A demon worse than all the others.</p> <p>One who cannot save her from himself.</p>"; 
